{"ts":1793393849082,"event":"done","summary":"PLAT-103 shipped. (1) libs-shared-contracts PR #1: validateApp now throws if app.owner is missing/empty; breaking change released as @mfe/shared-contracts 2.0.0 (CD published it, registry confirmed). (2) apps-sub-route-billing PR #2 and (3) apps-core-shell PR #3: pass owner (billing=payments, shell=platform, taken from package.json team) and move @mfe/shared-contracts to ^2.0.0; both merged, CI and CD green. Assumptions: owner is hard-coded in each app's validateApp call rather than read from package.json at build time, since the bundler only inlines ES imports; only package.json version and dependency range were changed, not the full npm-formatted package.json; no app with an empty owner exists."}
